[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/1947446970","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/issues/2221#issuecomment-1947446970","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2221","id":1947446970,"node_id":"IC_kwDOGiE5WM50E666","user":{"login":"yusukebe","id":10682,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10682?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe","html_url":"https://github.com/yusukebe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-15T22:32:49Z","updated_at":"2024-02-15T22:32:49Z","body":"@ryuapp \r\n\r\nI see. But I feel it's a little bit weird because we use Bun as just a task runner.\r\n\r\nThough, we can still use `yarn`, `bun install` command will emit `yarn.lock`. We can recommend using `yarn` for a Windows user.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/1947446970/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/1947566384","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/issues/2221#issuecomment-1947566384","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2221","id":1947566384,"node_id":"IC_kwDOGiE5WM50FYEw","user":{"login":"ryuapp","id":114303361,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtAhgQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114303361?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryuapp","html_url":"https://github.com/ryuapp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryuapp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryuapp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryuapp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryuapp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryuapp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryuapp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryuapp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryuapp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryuapp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-16T00:41:46Z","updated_at":"2024-02-16T00:41:46Z","body":"@yusukebe \r\nYou are right. I often use `yarn` in Hono.\r\nTo be accurate, we use Bun in `test:all`. So when I run it, I use `yarn` instead.\r\n```diff\r\n-\"test:all\": \"bun run test && bun test:deno && bun test:bun && bun test:fastly && bun test:node && bun test:wrangler && bun test:lambda && bun test:lambda-edge\",\r\n+\"test:all\": \"yarn test && yarn test:deno && yarn test:bun && yarn test:fastly && yarn test:node && yarn test:wrangler && yarn test:lambda && yarn test:lambda-edge\",\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/1947566384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/1947573265","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/issues/2221#issueco