hought I had tested in the past with paths other than `mnt/*`.\r\nBut I just tried it again and it was fastest even on Windows!\r\n\r\nBun v1.2.2\r\n`bun run test`: 1.51 + 1.51 + 1.39 = 4.41s.\r\n\r\nThis issue is resolved, thank you again.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/1987087989/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]